<title>GREECE: ATHLETICS-WORLD CHAMPIONSHIPS TIMETABLE - AUGUST 4.</title>
<headline>ATHLETICS-WORLD CHAMPIONSHIPS TIMETABLE - AUGUST 4.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Timetable for the third day</p>
<p>of competition at the world athletics championships on Monday</p>
<p>(all times GMT):</p>
<p>0500 - Women's 10-km walk first round</p>
<p>0510 - Heptathlon - long jump, two groups</p>
<p>0700 - Men's 800 metres first round</p>
<p>1440 - Heptathlon - javelin, group A</p>
<p>1500 - Men's high jump qualifying round, two groups</p>
<p>1600 - 3,000 metres steeplechase semifinals</p>
<p>1610 - Heptathlon - javelin, group B</p>
<p>1630 - Women's triple jump final</p>
<p>1635 - Men's 400 metres semifinals</p>
<p>1705 - Women's 400 metres final</p>
<p>1735 - Men's 1,500 metres semifinals</p>
<p>1810 - Men's 400 metres hurdles final</p>
<p>1830 - Heptathlon - 800 metres (final event)</p>
</text>
